{ "Identifier":           {"ImplementerID": "1", "ImplementationID": "CAE-AOD-V1.0-I01", "AIMName": "1CAE-AOD-V1.0-I01"},
  "Header":               "CAE-AOD-V1.0",

  "APIProfile":           "Basic",
  "Description":          "Audio Object Delivery. Plays Audio Objects and Audio Scenes (CAE-ASM). A Basic Audio Object is played as it is, or, when it states a User Point of View, heard from there; an Audio Object is heard as a scene of its Basic Audio Objects; a Basic Audio Scene or an Audio Scene is rendered from its User Point of View, each member from its own if it has one, by spatial rendering: distance and air attenuation, the directional patterns of the Basic Audio Objects' Acoustic Profiles, binaural or onto a loudspeaker layout. What is played is also output, as a Basic Audio Object. One Port takes either kind of Object, one either kind of Scene; the Header says which arrived.",

